SUMMARY:Apex: "Tour of Frights" plus dinner
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Hiking and Outdoors Group\nOk yeah\, we'll be riding 
 around in cars for this event but the Halloween lights and decorations are
  outside so it counts\, right?\n\nJoin us for a bite to eat at Ruckus Pizz
 a in Apex right by the Costco at 6\;30PM followed by a ride around the nei
 ghborhoods and businesses that are part of the Apex Tour of Frights. This 
 wonderful annual tour was created by the Town of Apex.\n\nAfter our meal\,
  we'll form carpools then start the "Tour of Frights". We will choose from
  one of the three tour options then drive around to see the decorations an
 d lights until about 9:00PM.\n\nBy participating in this event\, you agree
  to the terms below:\n\nTRIP PARTICIPANT WAIVER OF LIABILITY I fully reali
 ze that this activity involves a risk of personal injury\, property damage
 \, or loss of my person or property. I hereby for myself\, my heirs\, exec
 utors and administrators\, and same for persons with whom are in my party\
 , waive and release any claims or rights against Triangle Hiking & Outdoor
 s Group (THOG)\, all of its owners and coordinators for any and all injury
 \, damages or loss to my person or property incurred during this activity.
  I also understand that THOG organizers are not required\, nor should it b
 e assumed that they are CPR/First Aid/Wilderness Survival Certified and I 
 am responsible for my own personal safety.\nQuestions about this event?\nC
 omment below or message me through Meetup.
